%% Source basis: Intel MCS-51 User's Manual [2] and NXP 8XC51/8XC52 datasheet [3]
flowchart LR
    E[Event\nexternal pin / timer / serial]
    F[Flag or request latch\nเช่น IE0 TF0 RI TI]
    SE[Source enable\nเช่น EX0 ET0 ES]
    EA[Global enable\nEA]
    PR[Priority arbitration\nIP + current interrupt state]
    POLL[Sampling / polling\nตรวจที่ machine-cycle boundary]
    ACC[Interrupt acceptance\nhardware-generated LCALL]
    VEC[Vector address\nfixed program-memory location]
    ISR[ISR\nsave state → identify cause → service → clear/ack flag]
    RETI[RETI\ncomplete current interrupt + pop PC]
    MAIN[Resume interrupted program]
    E --> F
    F --> POLL
    SE --> POLL
    EA --> POLL
    PR --> POLL
    POLL -->|eligible and not blocked| ACC
    POLL -->|not eligible| WAIT[รอ polling รอบถัดไป]
    WAIT --> POLL
    ACC --> VEC --> ISR --> RETI --> MAIN
